# Only src/ and the build settings go into the image. Data, backups, secrets and tests never do.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/TestResults/
.git/
.github/
.claude/
.env
backups/
data/
# Only the requirements go in, for the demo to show (Docs:Pages in appsettings.Demo.json).
docs/*
!docs/requirements.md
# Only the example models go in, for `model setup` in docker-compose.demo.yml. Not the real climbing one or the Swiss rail one.
models/*
!models/climbing-demo/
!models/consultancy/
!models/linkbase-code/
!models/archimate/
models/*/generate.py
scripts/
tests/
deploy/
*.md

# Local secrets (git-ignored too) must never be baked into an image.
**/appsettings.*.local.json
